{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/bd1d814537298da2ff8a189aa2a4817c.poster.avif?t=1770838892\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/bd1d814537298da2ff8a189aa2a4817c.webm?t=1770838892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/bd1d814537298da2ff8a189aa2a4817c.mp4?t=1770838892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/a64e04680d4ec5c5f66672a54b84c6ce.avif?t=1770838892\" width=413 height=65 /></span><br><strong>Typhoon Unit ~ Butterfly Requiem</strong> is a bullet hell shooting adventure where you swap between a trio of heroes on the fly!<br><br>Take control of <strong>Gale</strong>, <strong>Fia</strong>, and <strong>Casey</strong>, three flying fighters with their own unique abilities!  Through strategic character swaps, and the power of <strong>Synergy Boost</strong>, you can overwhelm your foes with tactics and style!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/c7ff0e93fbb62b93a03fda6255cecc1f.avif?t=1770838892\" width=227 height=65 /></span><br>In a land where fantasy and technology intertwine, cities across the world are under attack.  The only thing connecting these incidents is the <strong>Steel Butterfly</strong>, a sword wielding butterfly woman who brings destruction in her wake.<br><br>The <strong>Typhoon Unit</strong>, a small but capable band of airborne heroes, have been called in to put a stop to the threat.  Can the Typhoon Unit halt the Steel Butterfly's conquest, and discover her secrets?<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/18467b814564505011585755f7405676.avif?t=1770838892\" width=304 height=65 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/86c9b7d579e3dd51a416f0053d1d5f70.poster.avif?t=1770838892\" width=608 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/86c9b7d579e3dd51a416f0053d1d5f70.webm?t=1770838892\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/extras/86c9b7d579e3dd51a416f0053d1d5f70.mp4?t=1770838892\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Heart pounding <strong>bullet hell action</strong>!<br></li><li>Blast, dodge, and punch as a team of <strong>three unique heroes</strong>!<br></li><li><strong>Switch on the fly</strong>, and use the power of teamwork to make your heroes even stronger!<br></li><li>Battle a blade wielding butterfly, a rock star siren, a gadget powered puppeteer and more in <strong>challenging boss encounters</strong>!<br></li><li>Experience a world of magic technology and <strong>cute monster girls</strong>!<br></li><li>Pursue the mysterious Steel Butterfly, in a <strong>Story Mode</strong> spanning 7 chapters!<br></li><li>Test your skills, and go for the highest possible score in <strong>Arcade Mode</strong>!</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1198710?t=1770838892","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1198710?t=1770838892","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1198710/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770838892","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/